WEBVTT

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.620
We are security.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.590
You are completely surrounded.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.320
After arriving in the Synchro Dimension,

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.790
we were surrounded by people 
calling themselves "security."

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.770
You've been wanted in City since last night!

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.100
Submit peacefully!

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.680
You want a duel, do you?!

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.070
Sounds perfect.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.580
I'll teach you your place.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.280
W-Wait, Sawatari...

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.750
H-Hang on. Not you, too, Serena!

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.720
Action Field, on!

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.430
Field Spell Crossover.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.370
Duel!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.740
Abnormality in duel-regulatory system.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.940
Move E through J through the alpha circuit.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.410
Moving E through J through the alpha circuit.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:11.150
31.29% chance of a cyber attack.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.200
Have you located the point of origin?

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.290
Point of origin: D8-block.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.290
Cannot change to alpha circuit.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:19.120
Trying theta line.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.850
What's wrong?

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:24.680
We believe the surrounded suspects' duel disks

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:27.370
are interfering with the system.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.630
D-Wheels.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:42.850
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.920
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:26.950
Total Security Net!!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.590
Sawatari...

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:39.530
Sawatari was taken out in one hit...

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.760
Okay, take him into custody.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.380
L-Let me go!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:52.390
Who do you think I am? I'm the next mayor's son!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:55.050
So these are Synchro Dimension duelists?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.440
Now, you see what you're up against?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.020
Stop resisting, and come along quietly.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.760
You think that will make us blink?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.760
Serena!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.730
No need to worry. This was 
within my expectations.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.700
I... I didn't mean that...

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.530
Wh-Where is my brother?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.140
My brother?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.500
Layra...

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.160
Don't worry, Layra.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.060
I'm here, okay?

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.740
You take the boy.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:28.920
Roger that.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.180
Layra...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.890
Now, surrender without a fight.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.690
Hang on a minute.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.280
There's some kind of mistake.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.090
Please listen to us!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:45.070
You are suspected of infiltrating 
a Tops-only residential area,

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.180
causing damage there.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.570
Give yourselves up quietly.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.210
No! I don't know anything about that!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.540
We only just got—

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.420
We'll hear all about it in the interrogation room.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.840
In that case...

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.070
Duel!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.690
If you thought you could escape on these 
platforms, it won't be that easy.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.190
Listen to me.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.980
No matter where you go, don't forget your smile.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:19.800
That's right.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.800
This is the time...

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.310
The time when I need my smile!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:28.330
Just like when Dad saved Mom's friend.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:32.790
I'll resolve this misunderstanding 
with an entertainment duel.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.470
For that to happen...

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.050
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.560
Step right up!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:46.860
You're about to see something that's 
never been seen in this world!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:50.840
I, Yuya Sakaki,

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:54.760
son of the pioneer Yusyo Sakaki, will present

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.600
the entertainment duel, as only I can!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:01.310
Is he stupid? What's he doing, at a time like this?

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.270
I'll take my turn first.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.450
I summon Performapal Hip Hippo from my hand!

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.860
It's okay, don't be afraid. Trust me.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.330
Hey, now... You all seem nervous,

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.540
meeting Hip Hippo for the first time!

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:33.000
The monitor in D8-block is fixed.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.590
Now, the cheerful dancing girls, 
raised in tropical countries,

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.550
will show their stuff!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.680
Here, they go.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:47.690
I activate my Quick-Play Spell Hippo Carnival!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:52.250
It's show time!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.200
The effect of the Hippo Tokens

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:03.580
forces your monsters to attack only Hippo Tokens.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.440
Now, please enjoy their alluring dance!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.890
Did you enjoy that?

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.600
That's the end of Act 1.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.420
I humbly end my turn.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.030
It's my turn.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:32.660
I summon Vigilante Zeni from my hand.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.900
I activate the Vigilante Zeni's monster effect!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.490
By reducing this card's attack points to 0,

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:46.340
I can Special Summon one Vigilante 
monster from my hand.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.580
I summon Tuner Monster Vigilante Gata!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:56.550
Another Synchro? Then, this is definitely...

00:07:57.100 --> 00:08:00.000
Level 3 Vigilante Gata

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.030
tunes Level 4 Vigilante Zeni!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.680
Tear through the mist of darkness, 
which raises doubt,

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.610
and illuminate the truth!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.140
Synchro Summon!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:22.800
Appear, Level 7 Marksman Heiji Type 0!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.820
So this is the Synchro Dimension's...

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:32.170
I activate Marksman Heiji Type 0's effect,

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:36.430
and discard one card to destroy 
one of your monsters!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:42.300
And I deal 400 points of damage to you.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.040
I activate my Action Spell Guard Cover!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:55.680
This turn, I can switch one monster 
you target to another!

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.350
But you'll take quite a lot of damage.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:05.660
As long as I have cards in my hand,

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.060
I can use Marksman Heiji Type 0's effect.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.800
I destroy Hip Hippo once more.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.200
But Guard Cover is still activated!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.080
Are you okay?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.810
Listen, you'd better hold on tight.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:34.780
I showed you another beautiful fireworks display.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.750
Did you enjoy it?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:39.150
You're still running your entertainment 
racket right now?

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.990
Don't you realize our position?!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:47.080
I summon Lunalight Blue Cat from my hand!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:51.640
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.480
Now, bring it. Show me the 
Synchro Dimension's power.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.110
I activate Marksman Heiji Type 0's effect again!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:14.010
Layra, look at the fireworks. Aren't they pretty?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:24.140
Now, you're out of the Hippo Tokens 
you've been relying on.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.340
But I still have one card left.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:31.390
If Hip Hippo is destroyed by that effect,

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.810
he can attack directly and one-hit kill him.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.270
Now, it's over.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.350
I activate the effect of Marksman Heiji Type 0!

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:44.390
I destroy Performapal Hip Hippo!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.370
He's just a child.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.710
What?

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.910
What? Wh-What happened?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.990
Action Spell Mirror Barrier...

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.490
I see... So he picked that up, huh?

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.880
What a miracle!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:26.960
Action Spell Mirror Barrier's effect 
prevented Hip Hippo's destruction!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.430
Impossible.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:32.220
What are these Action Spells 
he's been talking about?

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.670
You don't even know that?

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.340
When the duel starts, they're spread 
around the field.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.860
They're Action Cards.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.410
You pick them up and use them 
to expand your strategies.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:46.100
I see. Then perhaps we'll use them, too.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.000
Action Cards...

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.890
Like this?

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:03.290
I activate Action Spell Zero Penalty!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:08.200
This lets me reduce the attack points 
of one card on the field to 0!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:12.040
Hip Hippo...

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:18.540
Battle! Marksman Heiji Type 0 attacks Hip Hippo!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.700
You let him take off 2400 life 
points at once? You idiot!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.240
What was the point of my getting one-hit killed?

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.270
At least learn something from me!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.270
Now, it's your turn.

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:42.240
Show me your Synchro at once!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.980
I don't take orders from you.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:49.950
Level 3 Vigilante Gata tunes Level 4 Vigilante Zeni!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.410
Tear through the mist of darkness, 
which raises doubt,

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.500
and illuminate the truth!

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.060
Synchro Summon!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:09.780
Appear, Level 7 Marksman Heiji Type 0!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:14.880
So you're also using a Marksman Heiji Type 0?

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.430
You guys are monotonous.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:20.240
Are those decks supplied to you?

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:24.250
This is awful. He doesn't show mercy, 
even with a child along.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.720
Are you okay?

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.840
You don't look hurt. That's good.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:31.060
If you don't want to be hurt,

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:35.200
stop resisting and come along quietly.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.730
Any further resistance will only 
compound your crimes.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.100
We have no reason to let ourselves be taken!

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:43.510
I'll finish you off.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.270
My turn!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:49.110
I activate spell card Polymerization in my hand!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:55.610
I fuse Lunalight Blue Cat and 
Lunalight Purple Butterfly!

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.260
The cat loitering in the blue darkness...

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.600
The butterfly with purple poison.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:06.120
Swirl in the moon's gravity and 
be reborn with new power!

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.180
Fusion Summon!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:13.700
Appear, the beautiful beast that 
dances in the moonlight!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.810
Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.370
Fusion Summon?

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:21.560
Fusion...

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.650
Attention, security.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:29.010
Head to D8-block, and help secure the fugitives.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.120
I activate my spell card Lunalight Perfume!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:41.060
I Special Summon one Lunalight 
monster in my graveyard.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.200
I Special Summon Blue Cat!

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.010
When I successfully Special Summon Blue Cat,

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:53.740
the attack points of one Lunalight monster 
on my field double until my turn's end.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.970
I choose Cat Dancer!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.830
I activate the effect of Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.390
By tributing one Lunalight monster on my field,

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:08.690
it can attack all of your monsters twice!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.200
I tribute Blue Cat.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:15.900
I attack Marksman Heiji Type 0 with Cat Dancer!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.830
Full Moon Crester!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.610
What? That girl is beating our deck?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:35.710
Don't you know that resistance will 
only increase your sentence?

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.860
Well, we just want you to hear us out...

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:41.950
What's wrong?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.590
Here, too?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.700
Calling in reinforcements for four people?

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:55.620
You're a group of cowards.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:03.480
If I hadn't been one-hit killed,

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.070
we could've easily opposed these guys, 
no matter what their numbers...

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.080
Damn, you people are lucky.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:13.340
You see that resistance is useless now, don't you?

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:16.240
We aren't doing this for fun!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.060
Give up and surrender yourselves.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.340
We're really doomed.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.340
The only way to break through the blockade...

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.760
My turn!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:30.500
Yes... This should do it.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:34.220
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:38.480
Scale 1 Performapal Monkeyboard 
and Scale 6 Performapal Guitartle!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:59.400
Now, I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 5 simultaneously!

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.920
Yes! He Pendulum Summoned!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.610
No, it's not over.

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:08.840
I also activate Guitartle's Pendulum Effect!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:13.050
When there's a card in the designated 
Pendulum Zone,

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.280
I draw a card.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.300
Come on.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.120
Draw!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.750
Please... Come to me.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:38.870
It came.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:44.180
I also activate Performapal Monkeyboard's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:50.610
Its effect lets me add one Performapal Monster, 
Level 4 or below, to my hand.

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.350
Okay, let's go!

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:56.320
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.290
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.100
Pendulum Summon!

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:03.640
Come out, my monsters!

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.620
Performapal Cheermole!

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:11.940
Performapal Drummerilla!

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.520
Performapal Trumpanda!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:20.380
Now, I have three Performapal 
monsters on the field!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.850
What do you think? Glad they're on our side?

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:26.840
What kind of summon was that?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.520
Frightened, are you? That's a Pendulum Summon.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:34.160
So what?

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.320
You're under arrest!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.370
Who are they?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.060
Action Cards. Fusion Summon.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:48.140
And Pendulum...

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.850
They do appear different than last night's fugitives.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.200
Well, how do we break through?

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.690
Serena, I'll draw their attention.

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.090
While I do, take Layra and run.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.060
Run?

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.300
Just trust me. Okay?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.230
Don't worry. Just leave it to me.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.430
Now, your attention, please!

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:21.710
The show is about to reach its climax!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:27.750
I activate my spell card Performance 
Hurricane from my hand!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.450
Let's make music!

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:38.400
For each Performapal monster on the field,

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.900
I can return one card on my 
opponent's field to their hand!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.840
Okay, let's dance together!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.890
Now, Serena!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:16.860
I'm not running! We'll beat them together!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.600
Serena, please!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:19.830
I won't let you!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.460
Marksman Heiji Type 0's effect activates.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.300
When this card leaves the field,

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:31.140
I can Special Summon its Synchro 
component monsters from the graveyard!

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.620
Go! Take them into custody!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.050
Spread your ebony wings,

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:16.520
and strike the ground with the speed of lightning!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.470
Synchro Summon!

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:25.500
Rain down, Assault Blackwing — 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:46.670
You're amazing! You were trying to protect that kid,

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:48.870
even in the face of all that security.

00:23:48.870 --> 00:23:51.180
No one who'd protect a child can be bad.

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.510
Say, you don't look familiar...

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:55.880
Where did you guys come from?

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:56.760
The truth is—

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.750
Forget it. I don't get what's happening,

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.700
but you can stay here until the heat dies off.

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:01.690
Make yourselves at home.

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:04.650
U-Um, who are you?

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.910
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Black Whirlwind, Crow Hogan.

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:11.830
The fun is only getting started!
